  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af67364e6961c7d301f6af56d97221dfb4206f09.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_Banner_By_Memokii\">\n</div>\n<br>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&labelColor=f091f6&color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&link=ttps://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3XF\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"更新日誌\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Changelogs-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&labelColor=f091f6&color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&link=https://github.com/EuphoriaPatches/Changelogs\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Euphoria Patches\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Euphoria Patches-050b14?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=8d50bf&label=官方網站&labelColor=e797f3\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"支援\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17%20-%20black?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&label=support&labelColor=black&color=f091f6\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/437130f3f10997f720ff0b788cb24cde3b3b8541.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_logo\" width=\"30\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; 一款 Complementary 陰影追加模組</h2>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e7b00cde9ddb9c5b8aa2132f65e46b634f3cb8c.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n</div>\n</a>\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Euphoria Patches</strong> 是 Complementary 陰影（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Reimagined</ins></a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Unbound</ins></a>）的追加模組，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a> 開發。</li>\n<li>以選配的手繪功能擴展 Complementary 陰影。</li>\n<li>所有選項預設為關閉，但可以個別啟用。<br>\n「熱門設定」標籤和預設配置檔讓套用常見選項變得輕鬆簡單。</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>重要通知：使用此追加模組期間，請不要向 Emin 回報任何錯誤，聯絡方式如下。</strong>\n<h2>📥 安裝方式：</h2>\n如果您不知道如何安裝 Euphoria Patches，請閱讀以下說明：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fhow-to-install\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/how-to-install/</ins></a></strong>！\n<h2>🔗 連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Patreon</ins></a> 上支持 SpacEagle17，並獲得預覽版本！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>官方網站</ins></a></strong>！</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>更新日誌</ins></a></strong>！</li>\n<li><strong>聯絡方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li>為 Euphoria Patches 新增 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fproperties%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>改版方塊</ins></a></strong> 或 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252flang%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>翻譯檔案</ins></a></strong>！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❓ 常見問題</h2>\n還有其他問題嗎？請查看常見問題頁面：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252ffaq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/faq/</ins></a></strong>！\n<h2>由 Ember Host 贊助</h2>\n正在尋找平價可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器主機？Ember Host 提供超值的方案與頂級的技術支援！\n點擊廣告橫幅或在結帳時使用折扣碼 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，可享首次購買 <strong>9 折</strong>。此外，<strong>50%</strong> 的購買金額將支持 Euphoria Patches！\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\"></a>\n特別感謝 Complementary 陰影的開發者 Emin，以及所有 Discord 上的測試人員！沒有你們，此專案將無法實現！Euphoria Patches 榮譽名單：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fcredits%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/credits/</a>",
